mage against minions).\nEach point of fixed Physical Penetration and each 1% Physical Penetration Lesley acquires is converted into 1% Crit Damage, but her base Crit Damage is reduced to 130%.\nLesley's Basic Attack restores 5 points of energy and her Lethal Shot doubles the amount of energy restored. The Lethal Shot effect will activate immediately after Lesley uses a skill.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_296a3745ef0ec7c978400b3e7f481030.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":5310,"name":"Master of Camouflage","description":"Lesley enters the Camouflage state, gaining double Energy Regen, 40% extra Movement Speed, and 85 extra .\nThe state lasts 3s or until Lesley takes or deals damage. Enemies can detect Lesley's position through distortions of their surroundings.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a8caf30fc02cfaa2f500311936dbfc31.png","video":null,"cd":3.5,"cost":30.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":5320,"name":"Tactical Grenade","description":"Lesley throws a tactical grenade in the target direction while jumping back slightly, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and knocking them back.\n\nLesley can cast this skill during Ultimate Snipe to cancel the state and immediately fire a Fatal Bullet at the target. The attack is only triggered when there are unfired Fatal Bullets left.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a15ed9f8facd0926ea8a8ecd200e25.png","video":null,"cd":10.0,"cost":40.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]},{"id":5330,"name":"Ultimate Snipe","description":"Passive: Lesley's Crit Chance is increased by 10%.\nActive: Lesley locks onto an enemy hero and fires 4 Fatal Bullets in succession. Each bullet deals 250 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 5% of the target's lost ) Physical Damage and restores 10 Energy on hit. Bullets can be blocked by other enemy heroes.\n\nIf this skill is interrupted, each remaining bullet reduces this skill's cooldown by 10%.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6126c3a551ed56f43e76df1f21510d2.png","video":null,"cd":40.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Lesley works best with tank heroes who can provide better attacking conditions for her, like Minotaur and Baxia.","heroes":[{"id":19,"name":"Minotaur","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ecd2c0843df7ec85044dafff6bf4553.png"},{"id":87,"name":"Baxia","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_80e408203869ca99302af195ac4f756c.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Lesley is strong against tank heroes who rely heavily on equipment. Because her attacks can deal True Damage that will ignore the defense these heroes get from the equipment. Such as Gatotkaca and Fredrinn.","heroes":[{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"},{"id":117,"name":"Fredrinn","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Lesley is countered by Assassin heroes with multiple movement abilities, which will cause her to lose her range advantage. Such as Ling and Lancelot.","heroes":[{"id":84,"name":"Ling","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_017bade52b9fc94bbc12615de6d75c08.png"},{"id":47,"name":"Lancelot","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dc4b821e49b904715172136017798da3.png"}]}},